OL,3,AGTA 6 breaks records as estimated sales
OL,4,Atop $2.3bn
OL,5,
OL,6,FGrand Theft Auto 6 is estimated to have
OL,7,Fbecome the biggest entertainment launch
OL,8,Fin history following the blockbuster
OL,9,Fvideo game's debut on Thursday, after a
OL,10,F13-year wait.
OL,12,FThe highly anticipated open-world
OL,13,Faction-adventure saw pre-orders and
OL,14,Ffirst day sales total more than 24.5
OL,15,Fmillion units, raking in about $2.36bn
OL,16,F(#1.8bn), according to analytics
OL,17,Fplatform Sensor Tower.
OL,19,FIn comparison, this year's highest
OL,20,Fgrossing movie so far, Spider-Man:
OL,21,FBrand New Day, made $2.5bn over its
OL,22,Fentire run in cinemas.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
