OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AElla Langley sweeps Country Music
OL,4,AAwards as Taylor Swift performs
OL,5,
OL,6,FChoosin' Texas was also named single of
OL,7,Fthe year and song of the year, leading
OL,8,FLangley to joke in an acceptance
OL,9,Fspeech: "This song is the gift that
OL,10,Fkeeps on giving."
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/19
