OL,3,AFiona Harvey to appear at Crown Court
OL,4,Aon harassment charge
OL,5,
OL,6,FHarvey of Camden, north London, did not
OL,7,Findicate a plea, but elected for a
OL,8,FCrown Court trial.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
